{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[{"->":"yellow_page"},["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"yellow_page":[["^宁无极百岁退谱以后，太玄门里的一段旧事。你是新补的侍读门人；监院把这页黄纸交到你手上，只交代半句：抄清一份，别添字，也别漏字。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^师祖，监院命我来抄这一页。我先把窗边那盏茶移开，免得压住纸角。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^同门比你早到半个时辰，墨都研好了；他昨夜便想抄。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^师祖，山下要的是一个准数。十个人排下来，清清楚楚，谁看了不发怵？ ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_4 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=intent","/#","\n","^发怵的是你，不是他们。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_5 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=sharp","/#","\n","^那……纸抄出去，人家是要照着讲的。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_6 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=uneasy","/#","\n","^天下习武者无数。真让我觉得站在我前面的，便这十个。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_7 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^都说这页是师祖亲手写的。我盯了半日，却没有见他落笔。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_8 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","ev","str","^我先记来路：哪些是师祖亲试，哪些是亲见，哪些只是消息。 ","#","^cid:br_ask_witness","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^监院要的是准数。山外若来问，太玄门总得有一句回话。 ","#","^cid:br_ask_public","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_source_first","re":true},"^有我试过的，也有看过的。还有消息，得看从谁那里来。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_9 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^你在姓名旁边留一栏做什么？莫不是还想多排一项。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_10 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","^不是多排一项，是记账：哪一条出自亲试，哪一条只是听来的。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_11 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^宁点了一下头，让你把那一栏留在纸边。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_12 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"not_all_alive"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_source_first","re":true},"^你们的总谱，什么时候归我写了？ ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_13 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=sharp","/#","\n","^我以为既然排了…… ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_14 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=uneasy","/#","\n","^纸有先后。拿着纸便有权力改榜？中间还隔着我没答应的一步。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_15 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^同门把那张原想送出山的净纸，又收了回去。 ","#","^beat:br_yellow_page_16 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"not_all_alive"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"not_all_alive":[["^这不是历代死者的最高名单。人得还在天下，我才量他；十个人，当时都过了百岁。 ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^有人数十年不露面。可靠的人最后一次见他，已经一百五六十岁，此后便没有可信行踪。 ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^那……没有死讯的人，要怎么落笔？ ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^没有死讯，不等于此刻一定还活着。不知道的，就留着不知道。 ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_4 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^那这张纸，山外拿去，到底算不算数？ ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_5 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","^我没有叫人去给十个名字各填一个今日住处。后来也没有按年重抄一张新榜——留下的，只是我晚年这一次判断。 ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_6 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral ","/#","#","^fact:br_alive_limit","/#","\n","ev","str","^先给未知生死留空，不把没死讯写成已证尚活。 ","#","^cid:br_keep_missing","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^若有可信死讯，又怎么办？ ","#","^cid:br_ask_reliable","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_alive","re":true},"^先写“无确讯”。这个尚字，等有确讯再添。 ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_7 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^同门要添一个尚字，你按住笔。宁看一眼，叫你别只挑省墨的写法。 ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_8 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"first_two"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_alive","re":true},"^已知不在的人，不在这一页里。 ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_9 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^你把问题留在页后，没有编一个今夜刚死的名家，来试他会不会改。 ","#","^beat:br_not_all_alive_10 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"first_two"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"first_two":[["^第一，“混元武祖”周道玄，太极旧掌，晚年居终南混元院。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^我年轻时与他试过三手。旧册没有写前两手如何，只在第三手之后，留了一句。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^这一手，我到今日也没看懂。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=intent","/#","\n","^那周祖第三手，能不能…… ","#","^beat:br_first_two_4 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","^我没看懂，你要我教什么？ ","#","^beat:br_first_two_5 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^第二，“万剑归宗”陆天行，华山旧宗主，曾坐旧总谱第一。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_6 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^他真正可怕的时候，不是坐第一那几年，是百岁退谱以后。旧册论他晚年剑，只余四字——剑已无剑。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_7 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^那四个字，能学吗？ ","#","^beat:br_first_two_8 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","^咳。我原想着这四个字旁边，还能添一张照图描的剑式。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_9 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=uneasy","/#","\n","^陆天行四个字，也没有变成谁都能领走的一套招。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_10 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral ","/#","#","^fact:br_first_two","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"br_alive"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^\"无确讯\"三个字留了空。你后来抄别的册，也先分清写不出与没有写。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_11 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.175"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^问题留在页后，纸上没添一个假字。留白原来也是一种回答。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_12 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.175"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^旧册为何不记周的前两手？ ","#","^cid:br_ask_first_two","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^陆百岁退谱以后，为何更可怕？ ","#","^cid:br_ask_late_sword","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_missing_hand","re":true},"^没留下。你若想知道，得另找能知道的人。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_13 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^你把页边那个推字划掉——第三手尚不懂，不能靠补顺前两手，便替师祖懂了第三手。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_14 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"third_fourth"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_missing_hand","re":true},"^列榜时有列榜时的剑。你只拿那几年的名字来问，问不到后来。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_15 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^你保留百岁以后的字眼，没有把四字评语画成一柄已经没了的真剑。 ","#","^beat:br_first_two_16 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"third_fourth"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"third_fourth":[["^第三，“九霄道君”张玄衡，武当玄门旧首席；曾短列旧总谱第二，重定禁榜后自请撤名。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^我与他论三日，真正动手只有一次。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^他的气还没有尽。我已经没有第二条路。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^第四，“大日金刚”慧空，少林达摩院旧首座，一生不入世榜。我五十余岁三上嵩山，终于试掌。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_4 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^只出了两掌。第三掌未发，两人便停。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_5 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^第三掌若出，输的是我。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_6 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^那就是三掌败…… ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_7 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=sharp","/#","\n","^他刚写了这个三字。你把那页只记两掌的旧稿推过去。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_8 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^fact:br_unplayed_third","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"br_missing_hand"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^前两手没记，你没替它编。页边推字划掉那一处，此后一直空着。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_9 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.138"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^你保留了\"百岁以后\"。几个字比一柄好画的剑难抄，却经得起问。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_10 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.138"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^请同门改回两掌后止，把第三掌若出，仍写成师祖的判断。 ","#","^cid:br_correct_third","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先追问张那一次真正动手，别把论三日写成连打三日。 ","#","^cid:br_ask_once","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_correct","re":true},"^差一个字，听起来确实像真打了。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_11 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=uneasy","/#","\n","^换一页。省一张纸，别把旧话刮得看不清。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_12 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^他刮掉那个败字，纸薄了一点。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_13 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"fifth_sixth"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_correct","re":true},"^话说了三日，手只问一次。你们若只肯记动手，三日也能给你们抄没了。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_14 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^同门先在旁边写了“动手一次”，又回头去看那个还没改掉的三掌败。 ","#","^beat:br_third_fourth_15 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"fifth_sixth"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"fifth_sixth":[["^第五，“海上飞仙”叶无涯，东海海天门上一代门主。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^我亲见他与一位旧总谱第一私下较艺，共十四招。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^十四招后，两人自行停手。那位旧谱首位当夜只说了一句——海上有人。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^那位首位未名，十四招没有谁被写成败者。我记了几十年，也没把听见的一句，改成自己曾与叶争过首。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_4 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^第六，“剑压九州”公孙无我，昆仑旧掌，两次旧总谱第一。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_5 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^第一次做第一，只是剑快。第二次做第一，才算会剑。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_6 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^你在别卷读过同一句，今日才听见说话的人并不准备替第一与第六再约一场。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_7 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^那十四招，为何没写胜负？ ","#","^cid:br_ask_fourteen","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^公孙两次第一之间，变的只有快慢吗？ ","#","^cid:br_ask_two_crowns","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_observe","re":true},"^两人自己收了。你问我看见什么，我只能告诉你我看见的。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_8 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^你没拿十四比九十七短，便在纸边另排一遍。那是不同年代、不同人肯停的地方。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_9 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"seventh_eighth"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_observe","re":true},"^你只问快不快，还是那一问。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_10 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^他叫你把写字的笔放慢，你反而先乱了一划。同门笑，你也只得重写。 ","#","^beat:br_fifth_sixth_11 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"seventh_eighth"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"seventh_eighth":[["^第七，“凤翅神尼”妙真，峨眉旧七峰首座，一生不入世榜。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^我三上峨眉，前两次未真正交手。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^第三次下山，删练了数十年的掌法近半。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^那一年，她比我深。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_4 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^删掉的那近半，是什么？ ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_5 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","^我只说该删。那套掌法此后仍对我有用，只是不必再留着。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_6 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^第八，“九霄龙王”燕九霄，六合旧总门主，由北榜第一进总谱，旧首位坐十一年。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_7 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^我见他与旧总谱第二“横天神枪”楚天雄私斗十九招。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_8 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^楚天雄还在用枪。燕九霄已经不太像在用枪。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_9 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^所以谁赢？ ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_10 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","^宁只把十九招那一行，再往你面前推近。你们还没有从这一句里，看见一场确凿胜负。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_11 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^fact:br_later_four","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"br_observe"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^十四招后是两人自己收的。你只抄看见的——这一条后来成了你记事的第一行。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_12 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.189"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^笔放慢那一划还是乱了。重写时你才发现，快慢二字原来最不好抄。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_13 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.189"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^删了近半以后，留下什么？ ","#","^cid:br_ask_deleted_palm","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^不太像在用枪，便是没有枪吗？ ","#","^cid:br_ask_gun_words","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_palm","re":true},"^先把不该留的去了。你们想听的那个人，没有坐在这里。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_14 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^同门收回刚伸出去的纸。他肯说自己的改过，不等于能替妙真授徒。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_15 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"ninth_tenth"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_palm","re":true},"^你若见着，倒可以问他肯不肯把枪借你。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_16 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=amused","/#","\n","^你听出他还愿意笑，却没有因此领到，那杆枪究竟怎样使的答案。 ","#","^beat:br_seventh_eighth_17 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"ninth_tenth"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"ninth_tenth":[["^第九，“天外神魔”赫连无疆，旧总谱第二，五十余远走西域，三十余年不见中原，回来后我真正试过一次。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^他走的时候，不如我。回来以后，我没有胜算。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^旧位置没有替三十余年的空白作主。我也没有说他在西域一定学了哪部秘笈。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^第十，“乾坤一圣”孟沧海，八卦旧总门主，旧总谱第一四年。我与他真正动手时，孟沧海已经九十余岁；后来又见过他百岁后的晚年武学，孟百岁以后退去门务，闭门讲武二十余载。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_4 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^他做天下第一的时候，还远没有后来高。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_5 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^十个名字都过了一遍，茶凉了。宁没有将第十划走，让你们把全盛的自己添进去。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_6 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^fact:br_last_two","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"br_palm"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^\"该删\"两个字你没有多解。别人练过什么，只有本人有资格说删过什么。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_7 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.104"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^那杆枪你终究没见着。纸上便只留\"不太像在用枪\"七个字，一个也没添。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_8 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.104"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^赫连重返以后，何处让师祖没有胜算？ ","#","^cid:br_ask_hl_years","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^孟九十余试手与百岁后再见，是同一场吗？ ","#","^cid:br_ask_meng_dates","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_return","re":true},"^我自己试过。后来，就没有。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_9 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^他没给一条能把三十余年全部填满的捷径。你把出走与归来分作两行。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_10 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"the_order"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_return","re":true},"^写清什么时候。你们现在少写几个字，往后便多一个人问错。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_11 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^你添回那几年的前后，笔已不如开头快，却少了一个含混的后来。 ","#","^beat:br_ninth_tenth_12 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"the_order"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"the_order":[["^门外有人在等。山下来取卷的，已经催过第二遍。同门先将十人依次念完，回头问：第一对第二、第九对第十，是否便照这张纸定。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^我排的是我看他们怎样。人真到了眼前，还有年岁、伤病、兵器、心境，当日的一念。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^若真正交手，师祖全盛时呢？ ","#","^beat:br_the_order_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","^宁沉默许久。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_4 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^全盛之时，一个也胜不了。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_5 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^太玄后人后来据见闻私判，宁晚年大致稳在返真中段；依他所评，十人至少后段，前五更可能近尾段。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_6 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^师祖，人已经在门外。这张纸，我拿什么话去回他？ ","#","^beat:br_the_order_7 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"br_return"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^两行之间隔着三十余年。你后来见人写传记，也先看他把空白放在哪一行。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_8 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.109"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^\"后来\"两个字被你拆成了具体年份。宁看了那页一眼，没有改。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_9 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.109"},null]}],"nop","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"br_source_first"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^同门取过你起初留了一栏的纸，要照抄一遍。栏头的亲试、亲见、消息，他先翻回慧空那页，问这个三字是不是仍该改。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_10 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.113"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^同门把手边那张净纸推过来。他问：这张若拿去改榜，究竟谁会知道师祖第三掌没出？ ","#","^beat:br_the_order_11 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.113"},null]}],"nop","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"br_correct"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^你把已经换好的两掌后止递给他。错句没再抄进新纸，他仍得自己把若出二字，读给门外来取卷的人听。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_12 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.117"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^你们还欠那一改。你从头抄清两掌后止，又写第三掌若出；同门等着，没赶上原想下山的那一拨人。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_13 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.117"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^最后问师祖自己应在何处，肯接受这一次他不再替你往下排。 ","#","^cid:br_ask_ning_place","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先把全盛之时一个也胜不了完整抄回，不省成天下只有十人比我强。 ","#","^cid:br_read_whole","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_place","re":true},"^宁只笑，没答。你还想问第十一，手已先从书边缩回来。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_14 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^我若能排进去，又何必写他们？ ","#","^beat:br_the_order_15 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^他合上旧册。这一问到此为止。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_16 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"closed_book"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_place","re":true},"^另一个门人仍问师祖自己排在哪里。宁笑不答，最后合册。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_17 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^我若能排进去，又何必写他们？ ","#","^beat:br_the_order_18 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_ning ","/#","#","^mood:br_ning=neutral","/#","\n","^你保留原问答，没有代他答一个第十一。 ","#","^beat:br_the_order_19 ","/#","#","^scene:br_room ","/#","#","^cast:br_ning,br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"closed_book"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"closed_book":[["^出了屋，同门仍捏着那页新纸，问你愿不愿一起拿到外头去。 ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^这样讲，人家会嫌我们没给一个准数。 ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=uneasy","/#","\n","^我们见的，本来也不只有十个数。 ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^外头那个人还在等。你说，这张纸到底要不要给他？ ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_4 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"br_place"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^第十一问缩回手的那一下，你记住了。有些纸，问到纸边就该停。 ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_5 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.64"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^全句抄全了。省字这件事，你在这一页上没敢做第二次。 ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_6 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.64"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^留下给下一位门人讲两掌与若出，先等他问完再交卷。 ","#","^cid:br_explain_to_reader","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^随同门去查能核对的旧记，只带问题与确有来源的抄件，不替人传一张新公榜。 ","#","^cid:br_find_record","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",1,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_after","re":true},"^那我也晚一日。你别又只说他错了，叫他自己念一遍。 ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_7 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","^你应下，把纸放平。少讲一个痛快胜负，要多陪一个人坐一会儿。 ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_8 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"after_copy"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",2,"/ev",{"VAR=":"br_after","re":true},"^那我去问谁收着旧来帖。若人家不借呢？ ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_9 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:br_peer ","/#","#","^mood:br_peer=neutral","/#","\n","^就先记没借到，不写看过。 ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_10 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^他点头，将原想带走的整张名次纸，留回屋里。 ","#","^beat:br_closed_book_11 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:br_peer ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"after_copy"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"after_copy":["^太玄旧册合上。十人没有因你问过，便都出现在山外；未知的旧行踪，也没有忽然补齐。你只多认得几句不能省掉的话。 ","#","^beat:br_after_copy_1 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:none ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"br_after"},1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^下一位门人念到慧空，果然先问第三掌是谁赢。你请他把若字再念一遍，他停下来，自己改了刚才那一问。半日过去，窗边的茶换过，旧卷还在两人中间。 ","#","^beat:br_after_copy_2 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:none ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^ending:br_reader_after","/#","\n","end",{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^收帖的人未肯立刻借卷，只答某年确有一封来信。你与同门记下可再来问的日子，空手走回去；今日没查清的，仍放在没查清的一栏。 ","#","^beat:br_after_copy_3 ","/#","#","^scene:br_veranda ","/#","#","^cast:none ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^ending:br_record_after","/#","\n","end",{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],"nop","\n",null],"global decl":["ev",false,{"VAR=":"br_source_first"},false,{"VAR=":"br_alive"},false,{"VAR=":"br_missing_hand"},false,{"VAR=":"br_correct"},false,{"VAR=":"br_observe"},false,{"VAR=":"br_palm"},false,{"VAR=":"br_return"},false,{"VAR=":"br_place"},0,{"VAR=":"br_after"},"/ev","end",null]}],"listDefs":{}}